@startuml lte-ip-common
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
title LTE IP после P-GW: общая схема выхода в сети данных

rectangle "P-GW\nIP anchor / PCEF" as PGW
rectangle "CGNAT\naddress sharing" as CGNAT
rectangle "Firewall\nsecurity policy" as FW
rectangle "DPI / Traffic optimizer\napplication policy" as DPI
rectangle "IP/MPLS backbone\nDiffServ/MPLS QoS queues" as MPLS
cloud "Peering / Transit" as PEER
cloud "CDN caches" as CDN
cloud "Enterprise VPN/MPLS" as ENT
cloud "Public Internet" as NET
database "NMS/OSS\nQoS templates, ACL,\nrouting, peering policy" as OSS

PGW --> CGNAT : SGi user plane
CGNAT --> FW
FW --> DPI
DPI --> MPLS
MPLS --> PEER
MPLS --> CDN
MPLS --> ENT
PEER --> NET
OSS --> PGW : APN routing,\nDSCP marking
OSS --> FW : ACL/security
OSS --> DPI : app rules,\nshaping classes
OSS --> MPLS : queue policy,\nDSCP/MPLS TC

note right of MPLS
QoS переносится в IP сеть через
DSCP, MPLS TC/EXP, priority queues,
policing, shaping, WRED.
end note
@enduml
